        "accession_number": "0001324404-26-000007",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-25",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "However, we and other fertilizer producers generally manufacture and distribute products throughout the year.",
        "start_character": 42839,
        "end_character": 42948
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001324404-26-000007",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001324404-26-000007-110cefe1e35b136b",
        "accession_number": "0001324404-26-000007",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-25",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In March 2014, we exited our phosphate mining and manufacturing business, which was located in Florida, through a sale to The Mosaic Company.",
        "start_character": 20864,
        "end_character": 21005
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001324404-26-000007",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001324404-26-000007-110cefe1e35b136b",
        "accession_number": "0001324404-26-000007",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-25",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We can also export nitrogen products via seagoing vessels from our Donaldsonville and Billingham manufacturing facilities.",
        "start_character": 38930,
        "end_character": 39052
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001324404-26-000007",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001324404-26-000007-110cefe1e35b136b",
        "accession_number": "0001324404-26-000007",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-25",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We operated as a traditional manufacturing and supply cooperative until 2002, when we adopted a new business model that established financial performance as our principal objective, rather than assured supply for our owners.",
        "start_character": 19013,
        "end_character": 19237
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001324404-26-000007",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001324404-26-000007-110cefe1e35b136b",
        "accession_number": "0001324404-26-000007",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-25",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We sell the ammonia itself or upgrade it to products such as granular urea, UAN and DEF.",
